%% EM-Zilla Architecture & Data Flow Diagram (FJ™ Cybertronic Systems)
graph TD
    subgraph Client [Browser / PWA / Termux Client]
        UI[PSP Vita LiveArea UI <br> css/vita-theme.css] --> App[App Controller <br> js/app.js]
        App --> USB[USB Detector & Serial API <br> js/usb-detector.js]
        App --> FM[File Manager <br> js/file-manager.js]
        App --> UIM[UI Manager <br> js/ui-manager.js]
    end

    subgraph SecurityLayer [Enterprise Security Boundary]
        IV[Integrity Verifier <br> security/integrity-verifier.js] -->|SHA-256 Check| App
        CP[Clone Protector <br> security/clone-protector.js] --> App
        RG[Runtime Guard <br> security/runtime-guard.js] --> App
    end

    subgraph AIOrchestration [Neural AI Orchestration Layer]
        TD[Task Dispatcher <br> modules/ai_orchestration/task-dispatcher.js] --> DE[Decision Engine <br> modules/ai_orchestration/decision-engine.js]
        DE --> CM[Context Manager <br> modules/ai_orchestration/context-manager.js]
        DE --> KG[Knowledge Graph <br> modules/ai_orchestration/knowledge-graph.js]
        App --> TD
    end

    subgraph Hardware [Microcontroller Target]
        USB -->|Web Serial API| MCU[Arduino / ESP32 Board]
    end
